items.summary:
❗️The enemy attacked with:
- Iskander-M/KN-23 ballistic missiles;
- 8 Kalibr cruise missiles;
- 6 Kh-59/69 guided aircraft missiles;
- 129 Shahed strike UAVs, S8000 Banderol.
❗️The main direction of the attack is Odesa region.
🇺🇦 Air defense systems shot down/suppressed 110 targets:
- 6 Kalibr cruise missiles;
- 1 S8000 Banderol;
- 2 Kh-59/69 guided aircraft missiles;
- 101 enemy drones.
Enemy missile and strike UAV hits were recorded at 20 locations, as well as the fall of downed fragments at 4 locations.

